            <div xml:id="d737">

                <pb facs="0952" n="853" xml:id="pg853"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">810.00B/106a: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Chargé in Nicaragua</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Ray</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1936-11-27T17:00:00-05:00">November 27, 1936—5
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>132. Your 234, November 26, noon.<anchor n="88" xml:id="d737-f1"/> Make no reply
                    to Nicaragua note until receipt of instructions from the Department. Transmit to
                    the Department a copy of the note if you have not already done so.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Moore</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
